{"id":"17c6a2dc05008a19","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Scale On Set","display":"df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set — ZFC Recursive Scale On Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set — ZFC Recursive Scale On Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set — ZFC Recursive Scale On Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f0d78eba77f4a30\" href=\"?note=7f0d78eba77f4a30\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\vec\\varphi\\in V\">\\(A,\\vec\\varphi\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\\)</span> 使用所列依赖中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a> 的固定自然数配对函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleCode}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveScaleOnSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveScaleOnSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\varphi(n)\">\\(\\vec\\varphi(n)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_\\bullet(k)\">\\(x_\\bullet(k)\\)</span> 均为函数图的取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\{2\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,x(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\n\\{2\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,y(n))+1:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(x,y\\in\\omega^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\{2\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,x(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\n\\{2\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,y(n))+1:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(x,y\\in\\omega^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}scale\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveScaleOnSet}_S(\\vec\\varphi,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi(n),A,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi(n)))\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists!b\\in2\\;\n\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y),0\\rangle,b\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq\\vec\\varphi(n)(y)\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y),0\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x_\\bullet\\in A^\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq k\\to x_\\bullet(k)\\upharpoonright m=x\\upharpoonright m)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq k\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(x_\\bullet(k))=a(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to x\\in A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq a(n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}scale\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveScaleOnSet}_S(\\vec\\varphi,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi(n),A,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi(n)))\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists!b\\in2\\;\n\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y),0\\rangle,b\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq\\vec\\varphi(n)(y)\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y),0\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x_\\bullet\\in A^\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq k\\to x_\\bullet(k)\\upharpoonright m=x\\upharpoonright m)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq k\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(x_\\bullet(k))=a(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to x\\in A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq a(n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>最终稳定值由一个序数值函数统一绑定；结论不再引用已离开作用域的存在量词变量。</li>\n<li>保留逐个范数选择计算索引的原条件，不另行加强为关于范数编号的一致可计算性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}$ 使用 [[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]] 的固定自然数配对函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\vec\\varphi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveScaleOnSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\varphi(n)","display":false},{"tex":"x_\\bullet(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\{2\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,x(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\n\\{2\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,y(n))+1:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(x,y\\in\\omega^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}scale\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveScaleOnSet}_S(\\vec\\varphi,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi(n),A,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\varphi(n)))\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists!b\\in2\\;\n\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y),0\\rangle,b\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq\\vec\\varphi(n)(y)\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{OracleCode}(x,y),0\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x_\\bullet\\in A^\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a(n))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq k\\to x_\\bullet(k)\\upharpoonright m=x\\upharpoonright m)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq k\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(x_\\bullet(k))=a(n))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to x\\in A\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\leq a(n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2813,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursive-scale-on-set]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","7f0d78eba77f4a30","a7e1b630ead60caa"]}